OL,3,GNEWSAFootball legend's fan tributes to
OL,4,Ago on display
OL,5,
OL,6,FTributes left to football luminary
OL,7,FKevin Keegan are set to go on display,
OL,8,Fcelebrating his legacy at Newcastle
OL,9,FUnited as both a player and manager.
OL,11,FThe club is organising the free event
OL,12,Fat the Baltic Centre for Contemporary
OL,13,FArt on 31 October and 1 November,
OL,14,Fshowcasing tributes left by fans at the
OL,15,Fcity's St James' park following
OL,16,FKeegan's death in July.
OL,18,FThough he was not from Newcastle, the
OL,19,Ffootballer arguably became the most
OL,20,Fbeloved figure in the Tyneside club's
OL,21,Fhistory following influential stints
OL,22,Fwith the team in the 1980s and '90s.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
